DESCRIPTION:Rand Comedy Productions produces\nvarious shows throughout Sout
 hern California\, Arizona & Texas\,\nincluding Comedy for a Cause. Every Co
 medy for a Cause show is produced\nin partnership with a local charitable o
 rganization that receives a\nportion of ticket sales\, after expenses. Come
  enjoy a good laugh while\nhelping a great organization.\n\nAZK9\nRescue is
  a 501(c)(3) nonprofit serving Arizona’s underserved\ncommunities through
  our three-fold mission of education\, sterilization\,\nand rescue. Founded
  16 years ago by a group of friends and former\nshelter volunteers\, we beg
 an with a simple goal: to make a difference\nfor companion animals and the 
 people who love them. Since then\, we have\nprovided nearly 20\,000 free sp
 ay and neuter surgeries for community pets\nand rescued more than 2\,500 do
 gs and cats\, including animals who have\nbeen abused\, abandoned\, overloo
 ked\, or considered difficult to place.\nWhile we are an all-breed rescue\,
  our work often focuses on Bully\nbreeds\, Chihuahuas\, seniors\, and anima
 ls with significant medical needs.\nWe believe every life is worth saving a
 nd no animal is a lost cause.\nThrough medical care\, training\, socializat
 ion\, and plenty of love\, we\nwork to give each animal in our care the sec
 ond chance they deserve. For\n16 years\, our community of volunteers\, part
 ners\, donors\, adopters\, and\nsupporters has helped us continue this work
 \, and we are honored to keep\nshowing up for the animals who need us most.
